任何人或机构可根据自身或读者群需要直接转载或发布，且无需额外申请、标注出处或注明原作者，
但不得更改文章内容；如有任何争议或疑问，请参考前述免责声明。

Any person or organization may reproduce or publish this text directly, as needed for
themselves or their audience, without requesting permission, citing the source, or naming
the original author — provided the content is not altered. For any dispute or question,
refer to the disclaimer below.

