与医生，不要因阅读本文而忽略或延迟寻求专业的医疗帮助。

This text is drawn mainly from the author's own experience and reflection. It is intended to
provide useful information, suggestions and psychological support to others facing similar
problems. The information and suggestions are for reference only; they do not constitute
medical advice and should not be regarded as a substitute for professional medical opinion.
Anyone who refers to or applies this content must judge for themselves and accept any
