author. If you have any questions or need medical help, go to a qualified hospital
immediately or contact your family and doctor; do not let reading this article cause you to
ignore or delay seeking professional medical care.

**紧急情况下，请优先拨打你所在国家或地区的急救电话。**
**In an emergency, always call your local emergency number first.**
（中国大陆：医疗急救 120、报警 110；其他国家或地区请替换为当地号码，详见 README.en.md 开头
